"dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1458": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053261 - Allow overlapping vertex groups.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThe code was previously assuming that the vertex stride is always larger than the vertex size which is not necessarily true per spec. This patches fixes that by computing the number of times the stride fits in the buffer after having removed the size of the last element (following a similar logic to what the (much better) webgpu spec describes to validate the equivalent API.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310994\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313674\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLContext.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLContext.h"], "git_node": "7627423477cab7ba7961efe96a945d36d4a22051", "git_parents": ["a7efcc5f1810f25a44974d11c117474741ba861a"], "node": "18f18a74b2d7651d7f57f30f211710a95322d854", "parents": ["3f2781522efddf35dbb7144bd441d66ec07f87c3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785418468, "git_changesets": ["7627423477cab7ba7961efe96a945d36d4a22051"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1459": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057118 - Reset the picture region when the decoder adopts a new image size from the stream.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314546\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315004\n", "files": ["dom/media/MediaInfo.h", "dom/media/platforms/wrappers/MediaChangeMonitor.cpp"], "git_node": "7b30fc025295d646a1261b33d40104a4fbcc8798", "git_parents": ["7627423477cab7ba7961efe96a945d36d4a22051"], "node": "852528491015fd296da21a7ca50b7c35293b410b", "parents": ["18f18a74b2d7651d7f57f30f211710a95322d854"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057118 - Constrain the picture rectangle to 