EContentObserver` check whether the state is still expected one  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThe lambda is a script runner so that the state may have already been\nchanged when it runs. Therefore, it should check whether the state is\nstill expected one, i.e., whether the lambda still needs to create\n`IMEContentObserver` for the situation that the focused element was\nremoved from the DOM.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315134\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315904\n", "files": ["dom/events/IMEStateManager.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/editing/crashtests/set-documentElement-innerHTML-when-embed-in-designMode-has-focus.html"], "git_node": "616451082c32c5d29119febc70ece55cb2e17f12", "git_parents": ["8ddb0d884d2aad6720c2c3be4c2b7e20996fc4d1"], "node": "7c71c957d7e0813a3e34e4172a5cfeffb6611a78", "parents": ["0cf88ec63889c098b53a1c3cd4de27adbc655ff6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785852447, "git_changesets": ["616451082c32c5d29119febc70ece55cb2e17f12"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1504": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057130 - Validate principal and filter type properly;  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315220\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315958\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "widget/ClipboardWriteRequestParent.cpp"], "git_node": "8cce065e2699aac6583d961be8d56c29f62930e6", "git_parents": ["616451082c32c5d29119febc70ece55cb2e17f12"], "node": "9cc4ec4d153fce1dbbe413914036e6892e17dbda", "parents": ["7c71c957d7e0813a3e34e4172a5cfeffb6611a78"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785852475, "git_changesets": ["8cce065e2699aac6583d961be8d56c29f62930e6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1505": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2057130 - Validate principal and filter type properly;\" for causing mochitest-chrome failures a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit 8cce065e2699aac6583d961be8d56c29f62930e6.\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "widget/ClipboardWriteRequestParent.cpp"], "git_node": "34424f1c2e9bfd90fdb3d8fdfb0bb9be2bec87c4", "git_parents": ["8cce065e2699aac6583d961be8d56c29f62930e6"], "node": "900671076d460b70d4a4d1f9ea7785534f668089", "parents": ["9cc4ec4d153fce1dbbe413914036e6892e17dbda"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785866844, "git_changesets": ["34424f1c2e9bfd90fdb3d8fdfb0bb9be2bec87c4"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1506": {"changesets": [{"author": "Leo Tenenbaum \u003cltenenbaum@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058665 - Remove document element from parent node before appending.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315092\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316260\n", "files": ["dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp", "dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.h"], "git_node": "3e27ca2ed5cff01385cae93f19e4e8214f170b8a", "git_parents": ["34424f1c2e9bfd90fdb3d8fdfb0bb9be2bec87c4"], "node": "ab2220e0f244f330def0e6c54d33a5bfd4368628", "parents": ["900671076d460b70d4a4d1f9ea7785534f668089"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785879505, "git_changesets": ["3e27ca2ed5cff01385cae93f19e4e8214f170b8a"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1507": {"changesets": [{"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056792 - Introduce CleanupWeakRefs for remaining list types  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315892\n", "files": ["dom/svg/DOMSVGLengthList.cpp", "dom/svg/DOMSVGLengthList.h", "dom/svg/DOMSVGNumber.cpp", "dom/svg/DOMSVGNumber.h", "dom/svg/DOMSVGNumberList.cpp", "dom/svg/DOMSVGNumberList.h", "dom/svg/DOMSVGPointList.cpp", "dom/svg/DOMSVGPointList.h", "dom/svg/DOMSVGTransform.cpp", "dom/svg/DOMSVGTransform.h", "dom/svg