://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312991\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316473\n", "files": ["netwerk/base/nsStandardURL.cpp"], "git_node": "86283df10c9b20abe40ff999dedbf4a4181da32b", "git_parents": ["de23857b7a23cef8c66bdfdb71f582d2667dcbc0"], "node": "1b48e09cd70b2189042ff408a4bde0beb0e13d15", "parents": ["1aa3a407b0c349058a675f43529b3cf8633e98a1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785983733, "git_changesets": ["de23857b7a23cef8c66bdfdb71f582d2667dcbc0", "86283df10c9b20abe40ff999dedbf4a4181da32b"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1517": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050294 - Backport cubeb test_loopback.cpp fix to address perma-failures on Windows.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nTest only to fix a perma failures caused by CI image change.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315965\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315972\n", "files": ["media/libcubeb/0006-fix-loopback-separate-streams-flakiness-windows.patch", "media/libcubeb/moz.yaml", "media/libcubeb/test/test_loopback.cpp"], "git_node": "68e6ef55f136c2f4ef84dfde7bded292fc337085", "git_parents": ["86283df10c9b20abe40ff999dedbf4a4181da32b"], "node": "5f499990542aac6faf2bba1780ee374c3f35163e", "parents": ["1b48e09cd70b2189042ff408a4bde0beb0e13d15"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786023443, "git_changesets": ["68e6ef55f136c2f4ef84dfde7bded292fc337085"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1518": {"changesets": [{"author": "Greg Stoll \u003cgreg@gregstoll.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058002  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314740\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316043\n", "files": ["toolkit/xre/dllservices/mozglue/Authenticode.cpp"], "git_node": "a9c967f83097d38a5a8cba23e39c92c308aec26a", "git_parents": ["68e6ef55f136c2f4ef84dfde7bded292fc337085"], "node": "5bfec51fbe1bd91311bd74672ff3d3161a4fa139", "parents": ["5f499990542aac6faf2bba1780ee374c3f35163e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786023466, "git_changesets": ["a9c967f83097d38a5a8cba23e39c92c308aec26a"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1519": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058622, validate selected options entries,  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314926\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316225\n", "files": ["dom/html/HTMLOptionElement.h", "dom/html/HTMLSelectElement.cpp"], "git_node": "4cb90f9fea3ee1b8014e0151e2f61f99d0517fc8", "git_parents": ["a9c967f83097d38a5a8cba23e39c92c308aec26a"], "node": "2fc64e7f34b7b51fac9c44213aa9cafab9f35a3f", "parents": ["5bfec51fbe1bd91311bd74672ff3d3161a4fa139"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786023488, "git_changesets": ["4cb90f9fea3ee1b8014e0151e2f61f99d0517fc8"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1520": {"changesets": [{"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057385 - error: member access into incomplete type 'PNeckoParent'  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316734\n", "files": ["netwerk/base/SimpleChannelParent.cpp"], "git_node": "e2ffc90807323212fbd65e1a677d83ec5eecf0ec", "git_parents": ["4cb90f9fea3ee1b8014e0151e2f61f99d0517fc8"], "node": "97e848f44ed4f23768aad1b6dc3d9e5c312e3a0b", "parents": ["2fc64e7f34b7b51fac9c44213aa9cafab9f35a3f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786023509, "git_changesets": ["e2ffc90807323212fbd65e1a677d83ec5eecf0ec"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1521": {"changesets": [{"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058008 - Make `TSFTextStoreBase` retrieve TSF attr \u003c-\u003e index with checking its type  a=diannaS\n\n`TSFTextStoreBase` should consider the number of supported TSF\nattributes from `IsEditable()` result which indicates whether the\ninstance is `TSFEmptyTextStore` or `TSFTextStore`.\n\nThen, we can simplify the implementation of\n`TSFTextStoreBase::HandleRequestAttrs` and\n`TSFTextStoreBase::RetrieveRequestedAttrsInternal`.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314564\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315919\n", "files": ["widget/windows/TSFEmptyTextStore.cpp", "widget/windows/TSFTextStore.cpp", "widget/windows/TSFTextStoreBase.cpp", "widget/windows/TSFTextStoreBase.h", "widget/windows/TSFUtils.cpp", "widget/windows/TSFUtils.h"], "git_node": "143dacdd188f491a5a1a0b4c1a0259c5b021bfad", "git_parents": ["e2ffc90807323212fbd65e1a677d83ec5eecf0ec"], "node": "bc9b7a27b8128d565b35e6e8a5685cb496423d0f", "parents": ["97e848f44ed4f23768aad1b6dc3d9e5c312e3a0b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786024031, "git_changesets": ["143dacdd188f491a5a1a0b4c1a0259c5b021bfad"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1522": {"changesets": [{"author": "Michael Froman \u003cmjfroman@mac.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053579 - avoid DescendingSeqNumComp\u003cuint16_t\u003e as comparator in std::set.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThis is a combined cherry-pick of upstream libwebrtc bf6f744d19, 5ecea90550,\n6395da1ed7.\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/bf6f744d19a84a7d0c3f5acbc844123a8197165a\n       Check RTP sequence number order when assembling H264 frame in PacketBuffer\n\n       PacketBuffer::buffer_ slots can be re-used by packets with with\n       different sequence numbers when their difference is multiple of\n       buffer_.size()\n\n       Non-H264 code path validates RTP sequence numbers continuity in\n       `PotentialNewFrame` helper, H264 code path missed such check as the new\n       test demonstrate.\n\n       Bug: chromium:537233963\n       Change-Id: I6af0f52bfcb3a4437450dffcece85bee7ce172cd\n       Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/490840\n       Reviewed-by: \u00c5sa Persson \u003casapersson@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48222}\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/5ecea90550816628fa124e7cf55f4cdbc5aa4a7e\n       In PacketBuffer use helper to find packet slot in the buffer\n\n       This is a preparation for using unwrapped int64_t instead of wrapped\n       uint16_t RTP sequence number in PacketBuffer. Using modular works when\n       sequence number is unsigned but produces incorrect result when signed\n       sequence number happens to be negative.\n\n       Bug: chromium:537233963\n       Change-Id: I515cb7441d052a2823eee4891bb4e17b254d602f\n       Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491920\n       Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48231}\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/6395da1ed7da9f3a8d97475c4e8db722d9415e6f\n       Use unwrappred RTP sequence numbers in PacketBuffer\n\n       Thus avoid brittle DescendingSeqNumComp\u003cuint16_t\u003e as comparator in set.\n       Such comparator lacks some properties like transitivity making it\n       dangerous to use with the std::set\n\n       Bug: chromium:537233963\n       Change-Id: I400b423ab3f0d557219d459752e00d211fd97450\n       Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/491041\n       Commit-Queue: Danil Chapovalov \u003cdanilchap@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy \u003cilnik@webrtc.org\u003e\n       Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48232}\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316662\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/api/video/rtp_video_frame_assembler.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/packet_buffer.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/packet_buffer.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/modules/video_coding/packet_buffer_unittest.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/rtp_video_stream_receiver2.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/video/rtp_video_stream_receiver2.h"], "git_node": "a037d63c95f48d9c77be484f066058471ff1d7a6", "git_parents": ["143dacdd188f491a5a1a0b4c1a0259c5b021bfad"], "node": "c05096988c748121c5f0fe3045b5173fb515f8c2", "parents": ["bc9b7a27b8128d565b35e6e8a5685cb496423d0f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786039510, "git_changesets": ["a037d63c95f48d9c77be484f066058471ff1d7a6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1523": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054740 - Harden image transferable buffer size validation;  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316446\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "gfx/2d/DataSurfaceHelpers.cpp"], "git_node": "e8cf2001de09fc807475cc48b19199048e2bf158", "git_parents": ["a037d63c95f48d9c77be484f066058471ff1d7a6"], "node": "e8069cd659e2dd19ab1568172813d8087fcac1f1", "parents": ["c05096988c748121c5f0fe3045b5173fb515f8c2"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060106.  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316447\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp"], "git_node": "264c6ecac481b79c060892ded4e53d8ee9a3cefa", "git_parents": ["e8cf2001de09fc807475cc48b19199048e2bf158"], "node": "ee99e55403dabee6dcd38d5c2f80c3244131749f", "parents": ["e8069cd659e2dd19ab1568172813d8087fcac1f1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1786039532, "git_changesets": ["e8cf2001de09fc807475cc48b19199048e2bf158", "264c6ecac481b79c060892ded4e53d8ee9a3cefa"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "1524": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2060245.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316179\n\nDifferential Revisio